graph TD
  subgraph Logic [Pure logic and data]
    A[World data table]
    B[Pure simulation]
    C[Shared collider list]
  end
  subgraph Render [Render layer]
    D[R3F or Three.js scene]
    E[Patched materials]
    F[Camera rig]
  end
  subgraph Budget [Browser budgets]
    G[Pixel ratio cap]
    H[One shadow light]
    I[Capped time step]
  end
  J[Static host]
  A -->|boxes and gated triggers| C
  C -->|resolved position| F
  B -->|state flags| D
  E -->|same uniforms for mesh and shadow| D
  F --> D
  G --> D
  H --> D
  I -->|fixed steps| B
  D -->|static bundle| J
